@startuml
title ONE Classics Nexus - End-to-End Appraisal and Valuation Sequence
autonumber

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 140
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam NotePadding 10

actor Appraiser as User
participant "WinForms UI\n(MainShell / Workspace)" as UI
participant "Nexus API\n(Controllers + Middleware)" as API
participant "Application Layer\n(Use Cases / DTO Mapping)" as APP
participant "Domain / Core Engine\n(Condition, Comparable,\nSimilarity, Market,\nValuation, Confidence, Trace)" as ENG
participant "Infrastructure\n(Repositories / Dapper / File Storage)" as INF
database "MariaDB\nNexus Source of Truth" as DB
participant "Report Generator" as RPT

== Intake ==
User -> UI : Create vehicle and appraisal request
note right of UI
Message intent:
Start the inspection-driven workflow from the operational shell.
UI is the primary admin/field entry point.
end note

UI -> API : POST /api/vehicles
note over UI,API
Annotation:
Vehicle intake enters through REST and should return DTOs only.
ProblemDetails is used for invalid requests.
end note

API -> APP : CreateVehicle(command)
APP -> INF : Insert vehicle
INF -> DB : INSERT vehicles
DB --> INF : vehicle_id
INF --> APP : Vehicle persisted
APP --> API : VehicleResponse
API --> UI : 201 Created + vehicle payload

UI -> API : POST /api/appraisals
note over UI,API
Annotation:
Appraisal creation establishes the working record
that all downstream inspection, comparables, valuation,
and reporting actions attach to.
end note

API -> APP : CreateAppraisal(command)
APP -> INF : Insert appraisal
INF -> DB : INSERT appraisals
DB --> INF : appraisal_id, row_version
INF --> APP : Appraisal persisted
APP --> API : AppraisalResponse
API --> UI : 201 Created + appraisal payload

== Inspection Setup ==
User -> UI : Start inspection
UI -> API : POST /api/inspections

note over UI,API
Annotation:
Inspection record is created before detailed scoring.
Inspection types support Standard, Custom, or Vintage.
end note

API -> APP : CreateInspection(command)
APP -> INF : Insert inspection
INF -> DB : INSERT inspections
DB --> INF : inspection_id
INF --> APP : Inspection persisted
APP --> API : InspectionResponse
API --> UI : 201 Created + inspection payload

== 12-System Score Capture ==
loop For each system 1..12
  User -> UI : Enter findings, notes, red flags, 0-5 score
  note right of UI
  Message intent:
  Capture structured inspection data as the source of truth,
  including system_number, system_key, score_0_to_5, weight,
  notes, and is_red_flag.
  end note

  UI -> API : PUT /api/inspections/{inspectionId}/scores
  API -> APP : SaveInspectionScores(command)
  APP -> INF : Upsert score rows
  INF -> DB : INSERT/UPDATE condition_scores
  DB --> INF : persisted score rows
  INF --> APP : Score set saved
  APP --> API : InspectionScoresResponse
  API --> UI : 200 OK + saved scores
end

== Comparable Sales Capture ==
User -> UI : Add comparable sales
UI -> API : POST /api/appraisals/{appraisalId}/comparables
note over UI,API
Annotation:
Comparables must be normalized enough for similarity
and valuation math, not just stored as free-form notes.
end note

API -> APP : CreateComparable(command)
APP -> INF : Insert comparable sale
INF -> DB : INSERT comparable_sales
DB --> INF : comparable_id
INF --> APP : Comparable persisted
APP --> API : ComparableResponse
API --> UI : 201 Created + comparable payload

UI -> API : GET /api/appraisals/{appraisalId}/comparables
API -> APP : ListComparables(query)
APP -> INF : Load comp set
INF -> DB : SELECT comparable_sales WHERE appraisal_id = ?
DB --> INF : comp rows
INF --> APP : comparable DTOs
APP --> API : comp list
API --> UI : 200 OK + comparables

== Valuation Run ==
User -> UI : Run valuation
UI -> API : POST /api/appraisals/{appraisalId}/valuation/run
note over UI,API
Annotation:
This is the orchestration boundary where API/Application
assemble the deterministic valuation input set.
end note

API -> APP : RunValuation(command)

group Load valuation inputs
  APP -> INF : Load appraisal aggregate
  INF -> DB : SELECT appraisals, vehicles, inspections, condition_scores, comparable_sales
  DB --> INF : source rows
  INF --> APP : hydrated DTOs / models
end

APP -> ENG : Execute valuation input pipeline
note over APP,ENG
Annotation:
The design calls for Condition, Comparable, Similarity,
Market, Valuation, Confidence, and Trace engines.
The engine output must be reproducible and auditable.
end note

group Engine pipeline
  ENG -> ENG : Condition Engine\nnormalize 12-system scores to condition index
  note right of ENG
  Output:
  normalized condition index (0-100)
  plus red-flag-aware system rollups
  end note

  ENG -> ENG : Similarity Engine\nscore each comp against subject
  note right of ENG
  Factors:
  year, drivetrain, engine/trans, condition,
  restoration/originality style, and related fit.
  end note

  ENG -> ENG : Comparable Engine\nadjust comp prices
  note right of ENG
  Output:
  adjusted comparable values for reconciliation.
  end note

  ENG -> ENG : Market Engine\napply timing / market effects
  ENG -> ENG : Valuation Engine\nreconcile final value range
  ENG -> ENG : Confidence Engine\ncalculate reliability score
  ENG -> ENG : Trace Engine\nassemble trace lines
  note right of ENG
  Must capture:
  adjustments, factors, comp contributions,
  and reasoning messages.
  end note
end

ENG --> APP : ValuationResult\n(final value, range, confidence, trace)

group Persist valuation artifacts
  APP -> INF : Save valuation run
  INF -> DB : INSERT valuation_runs
  DB --> INF : valuation_run_id

  APP -> INF : Save trace lines
  INF -> DB : INSERT valuation_trace_lines
  DB --> INF : trace persisted
end

INF --> APP : persistence complete
APP --> API : ValuationRunResponse
API --> UI : 200 OK + final value, range, confidence, trace

== Report Generation ==
User -> UI : Generate appraisal report
UI -> API : POST /api/appraisals/{appraisalId}/report
note over UI,API
Annotation:
Reports are generated from structured data,
not manually re-authored each time.
end note

API -> APP : GenerateReport(command)

group Load report dataset
  APP -> INF : Load appraisal, subject, inspection,\ncomparables, valuation run, trace
  INF -> DB : SELECT source-of-truth records
  DB --> INF : report dataset
  INF --> APP : report data
end

APP -> RPT : Build branded appraisal report
RPT -> RPT : Merge template + structured data + valuation narrative
RPT --> APP : report artifact metadata

APP -> INF : Persist report metadata / file reference
INF -> DB : INSERT report record
DB --> INF : report_id
INF --> APP : Report saved

APP --> API : ReportResponse
API --> UI : 201 Created + report metadata
UI --> User : Preview / export / retrieve report

== Error Path ==
API -> API : Middleware catches exceptions
API --> UI : application/problem+json
note over API,UI
Annotation:
Central middleware returns ProblemDetails
for validation, not-found, conflict, and server errors.
end note

@enduml